    "updated_at": "2026-11-23T14:45:30Z",
    "body": "Status. The prerequisites are done: `cargo xtask` reads directory suites for asset selection, the catalog check, the heavy filter and the quick filter (#3186 in `56faf1f89`, #3706 in `0e97ab7ca`).\n\nNo work starts here yet. The rule is a new rule of `AGENTS.md`, and no words of the maintainer accept it: the text is from the agent comment on #919 (Q5), and #920 says that the fourth rule is not in its scope. The question goes to the maintainer: \"Add the rule that a new integration test joins an existing directory suite, with the exemptions `ISOLATED` and `SLOW_BINARIES`?\" The place of the edit is known: `AGENTS.md` \"Testing\" (next to \"A test lives with the code it tests\") and step 6 of `.claude/agents/PR-reviewer.md`.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "pin": null,
