    "body": "Maintainer decision (owner, live answer 2026-11-23, question dialog): YES, add the rule \"a new integration test joins an existing directory suite\", with the exemptions `ISOLATED` and `SLOW_BINARIES`. The work starts now. The PR is a process change; the `PROCESS_VERSION` bump and the note on #681 follow after the merge.",
